WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.090
Meet Online Kids PC.

2
00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.296
A safe computer for your child, on the TV you already own.

3
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.726
No adverts.

4
00:00:06.726 --> 00:00:08.347
No chat with strangers.

5
00:00:08.347 --> 00:00:09.193
No tracking.

6
00:00:09.193 --> 00:00:11.659
And nothing to buy or install.

7
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:13.588
Step one.

8
00:00:13.588 --> 00:00:16.355
Open the web browser on your smart TV —

9
00:00:16.355 --> 00:00:17.490
Silk on Fire TV,

10
00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.908
Internet on Samsung,

11
00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:20.398
or Web Browser on LG.

12
00:00:20.398 --> 00:00:22.521
Then go to kidspc.online.

13
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.035
Step two.

14
00:00:24.035 --> 00:00:26.763
Sign in with a code instead of a password.

15
00:00:26.763 --> 00:00:28.842
Six digits arrive on your phone.

16
00:00:28.842 --> 00:00:31.115
Type them on the TV, and you're in.

17
00:00:31.115 --> 00:00:32.894
You only do this once.

18
00:00:33.744 --> 00:00:34.345
Step three.

19
00:00:34.345 --> 00:00:35.983
On your phone, add your child.

20
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:37.731
Then choose their minutes a day,

21
00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:39.042
the hours they can play,

22
00:00:39.042 --> 00:00:41.467
and exactly which games they may open.

23
00:00:42.744 --> 00:00:43.325
Step four.

24
00:00:43.325 --> 00:00:44.546
Hand over the remote.

25
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:48.789
Your child picks their picture and types their own four-digit code.

26
00:00:50.244 --> 00:00:52.016
Arrows to move, OK to play.

27
00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:54.575
Every game works with just the remote —

28
00:00:54.575 --> 00:00:54.969
maths,

29
00:00:54.969 --> 00:00:55.428
typing,

30
00:00:55.428 --> 00:00:56.019
spelling,

31
00:00:56.019 --> 00:00:56.544
drawing,

32
00:00:56.544 --> 00:00:58.075
music and puzzles.

33
00:01:00.744 --> 00:01:04.277
When today's minutes are used up, the session ends on its own.

34
00:01:04.277 --> 00:01:06.393
The computer says no — not you.

35
00:01:07.744 --> 00:01:11.017
Nothing your child draws, writes or codes is ever uploaded.

36
00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:13.641
And you can delete everything in one tap.

37
00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:17.195
Try every game free at kidspc.online.

38
00:01:17.195 --> 00:01:18.511
No sign-up needed.

39
00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:21.273
Made in India by Gagan and Vansh.
